1
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:07,480
Go to rpf.io/ML4K

2
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:10,920
Click on 'Get started', then 'Try it now'.

3
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:16,560
Add a new project, call it 'Fish food', 
and set it to learn to recognise sounds.

4
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:19,440
Store the data in your web browser.

5
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:21,520
Click on the name of the project,

6
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,160
then click 'Train'.

7
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:29,640
Allow microphone access if you are asked.

